<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective Oct 9.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     22.06     23.29	  5.27-10.50 4.66-9.89</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     22.06     23.29	  5.08-10.07 4.46-9.46</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.28     32.23	  12.09	9.12</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.28     32.23	  7.57	 4.67</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.32	  0.39	 0.34</p>
</text>
